WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.026 --> 00:00:02.535
Retry an experiment

2
00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:04.653
Open the workflow view

3
00:00:04.653 --> 00:00:09.066
Switch grouping to By author (the drop-down is not shown in video)

4
00:00:09.066 --> 00:00:12.002
Experiments are split by the README's author

5
00:00:12.002 --> 00:00:16.684
Right-click the failed experiment → Retry this experiment

6
00:00:16.684 --> 00:00:20.864
The title is filled in as a retry; keep it

7
00:00:20.864 --> 00:00:24.069
The new README's retry_of points to the original

8
00:00:24.069 --> 00:00:29.120
The author comes from the original too
